# The wide frame's sidebar switched between shown a while and pinned open with a chat open (Rail.tsx's rail
# onClickCapture): MBUI_FIXTURE=webdemo MBUI_WIN=1280x800: 对话 pressed (folded, shown a while: the pointer is on the
# rail), pressed again (open), and once more (shown a while); the chat's bar moving with its page each time.
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
tap 把那个弄一下
wait 900
hover icon:chats
wait 200
tap icon:chats
wait 900
tap icon:chats
wait 900
tap icon:chats
wait 900
exit
